@startuml race_condition_sequence
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
title Race Condition — Przeplatanie Operacji count++

participant "Wątek A" as A #FFB74D
participant "Rejestr CPU\n(lokalny do wątku)" as CPUA #FFE082
participant "Pamięć\nwspółdzielona\ncount=0" as MEM #90A4AE
participant "Rejestr CPU\n(lokalny do wątku)" as CPUB #80CBC4
participant "Wątek B" as B #4DB6AC

note over MEM : **count = 0** (stan początkowy)

== Oczekiwany wynik: count = 2 ==

A -> CPUA : LOAD count → reg_A\n(reg_A = 0)
A -> CPUA : INC reg_A\n(reg_A = 1)
A -> MEM  : STORE reg_A → count\n(count = 1)
B -> CPUB : LOAD count → reg_B\n(reg_B = 1)
B -> CPUB : INC reg_B\n(reg_B = 2)
B -> MEM  : STORE reg_B → count\n(count = 2) ✓

== Scenariusz z przeplataniem (race condition!) ==

note over MEM : **count = 0** (reset)

A -> CPUA : LOAD count → reg_A\n(reg_A = 0)
B -> CPUB : LOAD count → reg_B\n(reg_B = 0)\n⚡ CONTEXT SWITCH!
A -> CPUA : INC reg_A\n(reg_A = 1)
A -> MEM  : STORE reg_A → count\n(count = 1)
B -> CPUB : INC reg_B\n(reg_B = 1)\n(reg_B ma STARE 0!)
B -> MEM  : STORE reg_B → count\n(count = 1) ❌ BŁĄD!

note over MEM #FF5252
  **Utracona aktualizacja!**
  Oczekiwano: count = 2
  Otrzymano:  count = 1
  Operacja count++ nie jest atomowa!
  (READ-MODIFY-WRITE to 3 osobne instrukcje maszynowe)
end note
@enduml

